{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful pirating requires the right tools! Equip your ship with different weapons, gadgets and mythical relics - as the captain, you have full control over the layout of your own ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLUNDER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter with different factions or sink their ships for some precious loot. You might even get lucky and discover an ancient treasure map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, enhance &amp; synergize! Almost everything can be upgraded, and then supercharged with clever equipment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIRATE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own pirate hideout to stash loot and expand your influence across the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ships, varying objectives and plenty of upgradable equipment -\u00a0<i>Roguebound Pirates</i> is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8030d0db85f063c730ccb8e931615c8b.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8030d0db85f063c730ccb8e931615c8b.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8030d0db85f063c730ccb8e931615c8b.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is in active development. You can join <strong>Discord</strong> to share ideas &amp; follow devlogs on <strong>YouTube</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327000?t=1756828629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327000?t=1756828629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/e109da3a0d3959f5957fef13d060da9c8c03ec86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756828629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/e109da3a0d3959f5957fef13d060da9c8c03ec86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756828629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.poster.avif?t=1756828629\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.webm?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/8ae014432aa458dc5eb37e386ebffebf.mp4?t=1756828629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>